Hi Avery,

Here's what's new in Gusto for your company this month.

Open enrollment, simplified
Open enrollment for 2027 plans starts in October. This year Gusto walks employees through plan comparison with a cost calculator, and admins get a dashboard showing who has enrolled and who hasn't. Set your enrollment window now so reminders go out on time.

Time tracking
Hourly and salaried employees can log hours from the Gusto app, and PTO balances sync to payroll automatically.

R&D tax credit
Gusto now estimates your federal R&D credit from payroll data and files the paperwork with your CPA. Companies with engineering payroll typically recover 6 to 10% of qualified wages.

Also: new state tax registrations can be filed from Gusto for all 50 states, and the mobile app got a redesign.

